Model files distributed with this software
------------------------------------------
The model files are distributed separately, in two model folders (the quality model and the fastest model).

* qwen38_27b_quality.yskn (quality model) and qwen38_27b_speed.yskn (fastest model) are derived from Qwen3.8-27B, published
  by the Qwen team (Alibaba Cloud) under the Apache License 2.0. They are NOT the original weights: each was converted to the
  YASAKANI file format and compressed (quantized), so the numbers stored in it differ from the original model, and its
  behaviour, accuracy and speed differ accordingly.
* bdraft2_k8.yskn and bdraft2_k8.shead (the small draft model that proposes next tokens; the same two files are in both model
  folders) are derived from the DFlash 2 draft model for Qwen3.8-27B published by z-lab (a mirror of
  incoai/Qwen3.8-27B-DFlash2, credited to Inco AI), whose Hugging Face page lists the Apache License 2.0. They were converted to
  the YASAKANI file format, compressed (quantized) and re-trained by the YASAKANI authors against a compressed Qwen3.8-27B model
  (an earlier YASAKANI conversion). They are NOT the original weights.

